44
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:48,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:01:50,930 --> 00:01:55,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"Attack! We Five Fighters"</font>

46
00:02:09,610 --> 00:02:13,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So basically we fight in order,</font>

47
00:02:13,010 --> 00:02:18,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and if we wind up beating all your
fighters then you'll find it for free?</font>

48
00:02:18,350 --> 00:02:23,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, but you're just a bunch of children.</font>

49
00:02:23,490 --> 00:02:26,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You wouldn't stand a chance.
You should give up now.</font>

50
00:02:26,390 --> 00:02:30,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please don't judge people
simply by the way they look!</font>

51
00:02:30,530 --> 00:02:33,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We'll do it! Right?</font>

52
00:02:33,030 --> 00:02:36,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course! This sounds like fun!</font>

53
00:02:36,370 --> 00:02:40,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">M-Maybe I should just watch...</font>

54
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:43,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not very fond of fighting either...</font>

55
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:46,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, then it'll be just us three!</font>

56
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:53,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You three intend to fight
against five people?</font>

57
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:57,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You seem rather sure of yourself.</font>

58
00:02:58,390 --> 00:03:01,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I feel bad for the people
we're about to fight!</font>

59
00:03:01,730 --> 00:03:03,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are the rules?</font>

60
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:09,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There really aren't any. You lose if
you give up or fall into the lake.</font>

61
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:14,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Short and simple, huh?
So the strongest one wins...</font>

62
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:17,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, the odds
are even better for us!</font>

63
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:23,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well then, let us begin. Who will go first?</font>

64
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:27,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will!</font>

65
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:32,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn! Good luck!</font>

66
00:03:32,090 --> 00:03:35,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I doubt you'll even get a turn, Goku!</font>

67
00:03:35,130 --> 00:03:38,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I might just beat all
five fighters by myself...</font>

68
00:03:38,930 --> 00:03:40,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't let your guard down!</font>

69
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I know, I know!</font>

70
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:47,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But this sure does
bring back memories!</font>

71
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It reminds me of the
Tenkaichi Budokai...</font>

72
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:55,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come out, Dracula Man!</font>

73
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:59,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dracula Man?
What kind of name is that?</font>

74
00:04:10,930 --> 00:04:13,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the?! It's a bat!</font>

75
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:15,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Am I supposed to fight this?!</font>

76
00:04:30,250 --> 00:04:32,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He turned into a person!</font>

77
00:04:49,170 --> 00:04:51,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is one weird guy!</font>

78
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:54,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kickboxing?!</font>

79
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:04,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He looks pretty weak to me!</i></font>

80
00:05:07,670 --> 00:05:11,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let the match begin!</font>

81
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:14,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I guess I'll check him out a bit first...</i></font>

82
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:29,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the! He turned into a bat again!</font>

83
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:54,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit! He's too fast!</font>

84
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:02,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Kuririn!
- Above you!</font>

85
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:10,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Let go!</font>

86
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:24,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This guy is insane!
He's sucking his blood!</font>

87
00:06:38,470 --> 00:06:40,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You freak! Stop it!</font>

88
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:47,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give up quickly or
you'll die of blood loss!</font>

89
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:51,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn! Shake him off!</font>

90
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How about this?!</font>

91
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you alright, Kuririn?!</font>

92
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:19,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I love the taste of pipsqueak blood!</font>

93
00:07:19,130 --> 00:07:21,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was a nice meal!</font>

94
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:28,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn you!</font>

95
00:07:28,670 --> 00:07:30,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, do you concede defeat?</font>

96
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:35,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give up and we'll give
you a blood transfusion.</font>

97
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:39,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You bastard! How dare you!</font>

98
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:47,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't get mad! Calm yourself!
You're losing even more blood!</font>

99
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:58,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn! It looks
like you have hair now!</font>

100
00:07:58,670 --> 00:08:00,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shut up!</font>

101
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:03,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh no!</font>

102
00:08:28,030 --> 00:08:30,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The match is over!</font>

103
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:33,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I come!</font>

104
00:08:34,170 --> 00:08:36,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Blood transfusion!</font>

105
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you alright, Kuririn?</font>

106
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:40,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say something!</font>

107
00:08:46,180 --> 00:08:49,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the deal? You lost really easily!</font>

108
00:08:49,650 --> 00:08:52,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was because you said
things you didn't need to!</font>

109
00:08:58,660 --> 00:09:04,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, who will
fight Dracula Man next?</font>

110
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:09,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But that's...</font>

111
00:09:09,740 --> 00:09:11,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...how does that sound?</font>

112
00:09:11,340 --> 00:09:12,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

113
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:16,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, now! What are
you whispering about?!</font>

114
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:21,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry, but could all five
of us fight after all?</font>

115
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:24,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See! You shouldn't have tried
to act tough in the first place!</font>

116
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:30,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! These guys are really little,
so could they fight together?</font>

117
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:32,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well?</font>

118
00:09:32,290 --> 00:09:34,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course I don't mind!</font>

119
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:38,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Their blood looks mighty tasty!</font>

120
00:09:41,570 --> 00:09:43,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very well! I will allow it!</font>

121
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:45,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you!</font>

122
00:10:02,050 --> 00:10:04,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got it? Do it exactly like we planned!</font>

123
00:10:04,550 --> 00:10:05,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

124
00:10:12,060 --> 00:10:15,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck! Pu-erh! Upa!</font>

125
00:10:15,090 --> 00:10:17,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Watch out for his bite!</font>

126
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:21,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go beat him! You can do it!</font>

127
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:30,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let the match begin!</font>

128
00:10:33,780 --> 00:10:35,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-Here he comes!</font>

129
00:10:35,810 --> 00:10:38,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now, Upa!</font>

130
00:10:47,590 --> 00:10:52,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You ate some garlic, didn't you?!
Vampires hate garlic!</font>

131
00:11:10,910 --> 00:11:15,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit! In that case... Hey, you!</font>

132
00:11:15,950 --> 00:11:18,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your blood is mine!</font>

133
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Porcupine transformation!</font>

134
00:11:35,570 --> 00:11:39,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Take that!
- That's it! Great job, Pu-erh!</font>

135
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:47,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What are you doing?!</font>

136
00:11:47,890 --> 00:11:52,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Vampires can't stand crosses!</font>

137
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:14,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's running away!</font>

138
00:12:14,050 --> 00:12:15,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Transformation!</font>

139
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:21,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come back here!</font>

140
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:33,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- We did it!
- That was great!</font>

141
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:36,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good job!</font>

142
00:12:36,310 --> 00:12:38,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not bad...</font>

143
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did well in finding his weak spots!</font>

144
00:12:43,850 --> 00:12:47,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the rest of my
fighters are even stronger...</font>

145
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:50,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good work! You two
can sit the rest out now!</font>

146
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm up next!</font>

147
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:55,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Right!
- Thanks!</font>

148
00:12:57,430 --> 00:13:01,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright then! Give me your best shot!</font>

149
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:03,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you sure about this?</font>

150
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:07,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're down to only two people now.</font>

151
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:11,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you think the two of you
can beat my four fighters?</font>

152
00:13:11,610 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's more than enough!</font>

153
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:17,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll defeat all four of them
by myself, just you watch!</font>

154
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:20,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me fight too!</font>

155
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:25,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku, you're for our
last resort. I'll fight first.</font>

156
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:28,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, I'm ready!
Bring out the second fighter!</font>

157
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:31,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha-<i>sama</i>! Try your best!</font>

158
00:13:31,990 --> 00:13:34,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't let your guard down!</font>

159
00:13:39,070 --> 00:13:42,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bring out the second fighter already!</font>

160
00:13:44,470 --> 00:13:48,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's already here.</font>

161
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:52,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where? There's nobody here!</font>

162
00:13:52,620 --> 00:13:55,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that old hag talking about?!</font>

163
00:13:56,770 --> 00:13:59,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can't you see him?</font>

164
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:03,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I suppose not! He is
Suke-<i>san</i>, the Invisible Man!</font>

165
00:14:03,970 --> 00:14:07,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-lnvisible Man?!</font>

166
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:10,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All right! Let the match begin!</font>

167
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:31,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I come!</font>

168
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:39,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-Yamucha-<i>sama</i>!</font>

169
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:44,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Dammit! This is insane!</font>

170
